body:
**🟡 Medium · maintainability**

Single `pending` flag couples unrelated mutations: a grant revoke disables Check status/Save model and vice versa. Scope each control to its own action (e.g. model form to modelAction.isPending, grant buttons to grantAction.isPending) to avoid unnecessary blocking.

**Suggested change**

```diff
--- original
+++ suggested
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-  const pending = action.isPending || modelAction.isPending || grantAction.isPending;
+  const authPending = action.isPending;
+  const modelPending = modelAction.isPending;
+  const grantPending = grantAction.isPending;
```

<!-- code-mortis:finding:e6c41055-3672-453f-a63f-cae5194779e5 -->

**🟡 Medium · bug**

Nesting `@apply sr-only` inside `@container` is a build-compatibility risk. The only other `@apply` uses in this file are inside `@layer base`; Tailwind v4/Vite processing of `@apply` inside a container at-rule is not guaranteed and may fail the build or silently drop the rule, leaving `.settings-cell-label` visible on desktop alongside `.settings-list-heading` (duplicated labels). Inline the screen-reader-only declarations instead of `@apply`.

**Suggested change**

```diff
--- original
+++ suggested
@@ -1 +1,11 @@
-  .settings-cell-label { @apply sr-only; }
+  .settings-cell-label {
+    position: absolute;
+    width: 1px;
+    height: 1px;
+    padding: 0;
+    margin: -1px;
+    overflow: hidden;
+    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
+    white-space: nowrap;
+    border: 0;
+  }
```

